# =========================================================
# Root-level Training Model Checkpoints
# (not needed for deployment — leading slash makes this match
# ONLY the root-level models/ folder, not frontend/models/ —
# without it, Git would ignore frontend/models/best.pt too,
# which breaks the deployed app)
# =========================================================

/models/


